  "prefLabel": "En 603.01 Information to Customers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 603.01 Information to Customers.\n\n(a) Each water utility shall, upon request, provide a customer with a copy of the most recent chemical analysis of the water supplied.\n\n(b) Not more than one chemical analysis per customer per year shall be required pursuant to (a) above.\n\nSource. #13911, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 600)",
